  "plain": "A former Air Force officer named Robert Salas says that in 2025 he wrote a rebuttal listing 14 reasons why an EMP test, a burst of electromagnetic energy that can knock out electronics, \"couldn't have been\" what shut down his nuclear missiles. He was answering a Wall Street Journal article in which the Pentagon office that studies unexplained aerial reports gave the test as the explanation. Salas, who says a UFO shut down the missiles while he was on duty, tells this himself to Michels, and he is pushing back on the official account of his own story."
